OL,3,GNEWSAAbout 280 people evacuated after
OL,4,Afire at seaside hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 280 people have been evacuated
OL,7,Ffrom a seaside hotel after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout overnight.
OL,10,FKent Fire and Rescue Service said 26
OL,11,Ffire engines were sent to the Grand
OL,12,FBurstin Hotel in Folkestone at about
OL,13,F01:05 BST.
OL,15,FIn an update at 08:30, it said 10 fire
OL,16,Fengines remained at the scene
OL,17,F"dampening down any remaining
OL,18,Fhotspots".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
